  # Prompt Engineering For storytelling: From Chaos to Characters Building
  
  [![Karthikeya Suppa](https://miro.medium.com/v2/da:true/resize:fill:32:32/0*7OercWHJh-NJs7Re)](https://medium.com/@karthikeyasuppa01?source=post_page---byline--6550cd35ee7d---------------------------------------)
  
